{"id": "clm:c8d26c488b495db186339384bf31f96b8935500bd0b632ed10028016e030f7b2", "type": "statement", "text": "The integration API specifies fallback to default headers when a header template fails, exceeds 4 KB, or produces an invalid JSON name-to-value object. Receivers must not assume template-provided authentication headers are invariably present. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/operation/operation-creategroupintegration", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:d91e4be3950ecf91be7b622d6d51fb7bb34e68a7ecd8afccb5022b7e87ac5dca"]}
{"id": "clm:0aac40f610e51c6b7b99227bb7056f4a8c4fc0c51b77b38688b8e975967dc8a2", "type": "statement", "text": "The Webhook Secret field generates a signature rather than transmitting a bearer token. Atlas also documents FreeMarker header and body templates, so the secret-field limitation alone does not establish a universal proxy requirement. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/configure-alerts.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ab9d4ed708b30af10fc467ee6abeb5d3c1a321fb3e955ada9001cd80c728178c", "ev:ce64d855c2148db75316c274f28223db7d0eb42ceda3ace0f4386064499137c7"]}
{"id": "clm:51af478c682298a21ed7a75302909bce988a9bf4e2246631eaa2f0765dfc5e8d", "type": "statement", "text": "HMAC depends on a shared secret, rather than a public verification key. RFC 2104 calls for randomly generated keys, secrecy protection and periodic refresh; apply this key-management guidance to the Atlas signing secret. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1d778a2ff0e70b51de809c9f0f640c78a3eafdba25ca6d4bfe01ba4e6fd61b42", "ev:250a7274d5a2524327d85597c67462293230292fddff1b58b14dfaf768478570", "ev:86a16a89db4b2db77ac5fbfca3cc048abc913a4d7ed3ae958cd59d17257f3933", "ev:c993a7331b7a790be7c9a4751688db1780d8e86894e4d43e9797c1b90f43b6fd"]}
{"id": "clm:476ebc12a0dd9751a22ed2302405af6ca280724bc26713bafcb527fe29f0a2cf", "type": "statement", "text": "With a webhook secret configured, Atlas documents X-MMS-Signature as the Base64 HMAC-SHA-1 of the request body; verification recomputes it with that secret and compares the header. Without a configured secret the signature header is optional. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/configure-alerts.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3e9ef7a707add598fc2459953707a8b491b64d297e9289039ac96c616bb36aeb", "ev:c993a7331b7a790be7c9a4751688db1780d8e86894e4d43e9797c1b90f43b6fd"]}
{"id": "clm:c4354d00659ce5f6d005a5c696e349ce5c68094d43dd7158373d014839a57495", "type": "statement", "text": "Implementation advice: retain the original request-body bytes before JSON parsing. With a compatible Node.js crypto build, createHmac('sha1', secret).update(rawBody).digest('base64') implements the documented calculation; reserialization can change signed bytes. This is a derived implementation, not an Atlas-provided code sample. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://nodejs.org/api/crypto.html", "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:a153f3294d4b500c5524fb2edce263f2a70ec58bdb821e165fae820f015808c3", "ev:c993a7331b7a790be7c9a4751688db1780d8e86894e4d43e9797c1b90f43b6fd", "ev:f52b6d045d6ed67299b1005115eae5a1bec33d540e90fe37ccd432feb0ddeed8"]}
{"id": "clm:e7cda2f62b6f4e2da8ad7a9992432cf349027ca81a56e42ac1a471f700440fe7", "type": "statement", "text": "Node.js timingSafeEqual compares bytes in constant time and is suitable for HMAC digests. Its inputs must have equal byte lengths or it throws. Validate lengths first; the surrounding verifier still needs review for timing leaks. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://nodejs.org/api/crypto.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3a80e367f9b7338d4b799b85274245f15c6f2e0a558bc0d0dd5949f6aed69ce8"]}
{"id": "clm:26a79bc6dce4adc66cb5194ca01598b289df87db2dff3d65cb09163ef489c95e", "type": "statement", "text": "The Atlas verification procedure describes a MAC of the body and no separate signed delivery timestamp or replay-rejection window. Inference: a matching signature alone does not establish delivery freshness; replay handling requires a receiver policy. This is a documentation boundary, not a demonstrated Atlas vulnerability. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:67a70f57739266a50602ed13f5d40143846b25b3eeec5a7975e99b7959cce90e", "ev:c993a7331b7a790be7c9a4751688db1780d8e86894e4d43e9797c1b90f43b6fd"]}
{"id": "clm:ac2949e3bbadbda4c26881894bc1d98ffedad739a7fd5f847805b5d233bc040c", "type": "statement", "text": "The integration API documents custom header templates, but excludes the webhook secret and signature from template variables. Therefore, neither universal bearer-header impossibility nor a mandatory proxy follows from the signing-secret restriction. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas Webhook HMAC Signature Verification"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/operation/operation-creategroupintegration"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:19182e0072537d83a82f32bdcd0807217824ff9947e7b4518749cc7aafe1ffbe", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ce64d855c2148db75316c274f28223db7d0eb42ceda3ace0f4386064499137c7", "ev:d91e4be3950ecf91be7b622d6d51fb7bb34e68a7ecd8afccb5022b7e87ac5dca"]}
